{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"better\":\"X\",\"regress\":\"有：X 在 S01 这类没有分时出现的段落里感受词偏密，纵向交替扫读不如 Y 左右分栏省力，个别段落也有意象重复的问题。\",\"nets\":{\"scan\":\"Y\",\"point\":\"X\",\"why\":\"X\",\"whole\":\"X\",\"fine\":\"X\"},\"why\":\"我选 X。关键词放大加亮，能让人迅速抓住每段心理转折；人物害怕什么、为什么收住、后来为什么又愿意敞开，动机链条也交代得更完整。尤其感受词与音乐乐句同步出现，让水波、呼吸、声部变化和心理起伏形成具体联系，反复出现的船与水意象也把前后串成了一件事。Y 确实更容易一眼扫完，但压缩掉的部分不只是字数，还有音乐细节、情绪层次和人物心理的微妙变化。整体体验我更愿意选 X。\"} </escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "156cb443-6e06-454a-acdf-3f8c7eefd0fe", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T230735524799Z", "elapsed_seconds": 122.609, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T23:09:38.155492+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "07eb9f57ffe74592f7f3c5afb8601579f288ead9210bb3427e279cd57650dc61", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f458